<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes unchanged in poor trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes unchanged in poor trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Monday closed almost unchanged in poor trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 593.33 from 593.11 on Monday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 190,249 dinars against 5.98 million dinars.</p>
<p>BTEI bank was up 0.18 dinar to 22.5 dinars. Retail stores Monoprix was down 0.38 dinar to 34.72 dinars.</p>
<p>($=one dinar)</p>
</text>
